110 = '## Acceptance (FIX-2v26 validation on a future UJ 6/1-6/13 run; proposed code edit set unchanged from v26; branch-complete PATH_CLASS with non-clearing unresolved states; 21 behavior rounds through V386; V387 round 22, V388 round 23, V389 round 24 if transported; no new EA code delta)'
112 = '   - Dispatcher and PATH_CLASS (binding order): reject UNEXPECTED_TAKE; freeze each H_STATUS; for any FIRED admission inspect the full same-chain pre-confirmation path and apply the fired-path flip test before branch or edge-presence processing; then select WW/FW/WF/FF, establish edge presence, classify PATH_CLASS, grade axes, and evaluate parity/allowed-set. An S2 edge after first same-chain S2PROMOTE_M15 is OUTSIDE-REQUIRED whether present or absent; it is not graded as a required cell and applicable pin checks still apply. NA-EXCLUDED is reserved for absent-by-design cells. Other absent required edges are UNRESOLVED/HOLD unless exhibited causal evidence assigns DIVERGED or PIN-KILL-EXPLAINED. The binding pin means a demonstrated sign-change in 5m structure bias before confirmation. Printed ltf opposite to trade direction proves opposite state only; it proves a sign-change only with a prior 5m value and a verified FL_BUF_LTF_BIAS-to-structure mapping, neither exhibited here. Without them pin status is UNPROVEN/HOLD. Fired plus established same-chain sign-change is PIN-VIOLATION/FAIL. Positive advancement requires exact emitted S2PROMOTE_M15 bar= or CONFIRM_PREBIND bar= (not CONFIRM_PREBIND_FAIL); UJRESEED/UJPROV alone is not advancement. WITHDRAWN_TERM requires observed ordinary terminal withdrawal before required edge, no advancement and no pin-abort; it is non-clearing. PATH_CLASS excludes FIRED and does not recompute H_STATUS.'
113 = '   - Axes: M grades row mechanics including unauthorized negative-control promotions; T grades take, hypothesis, no-false-take and parity. M PASS and T PASS are necessary, not sufficient, for clearance, which also needs the separately authorized operator-side 5m-series review or newly scoped evidence design and later council review. NA-EXCLUDED cannot satisfy a required edge. UNRESOLVED, PIN-KILL-EXPLAINED, WITHDRAWN_TERM, DIVERGED and unresolved OUTSIDE-REQUIRED pin checks are non-clearing; PIN-VIOLATION and NEGATIVE_CONTROL_BREACH are FAIL (breach fails M and T). FIX is diagnostic/non-clearing. P137 (pinned 8-June) and P142 (6/9 09:50 never-reseeded keep, tied to P030/P046) are the only required negative controls. P138-P141 are Weekly-VWAP regression diagnostics under P030, not required controls and cannot independently clear. Their KILL rows are context; no absent UJPROV/exempt claim is inferred. The battery cannot self-clear: fired B1 can at best be FIRED / no established sign-change / pin status UNPROVEN / HOLD; non-fired owed B1 also holds. Forecasts and absence alone never clear.'
115 = '     - B1 required present edges: (1) reseedDir=-1, seedBiasAl=0, nonzero reseedBar. Require exempt=1 only when row also exhibits m15 read-ok/match; prior R01/R04/R06/R08 establish this only for those bars. Positive confirmation may be CONFIRM_PREBIND bar=09:40 at pass 09:45; negative requires live-path shadow=false CONFIRMPOLL or CONFIRM_PREBIND_FAIL. B3 twin is conditional on stale 10:35 stamp and stored direction matching holder; future rows govern. Non-FIRED owed B1 holds.'
