120 = '     - P-KEEP: pinned 8-June identity and only-matching-candidate claim are disk-asserted; KILL/UJPROV lack sess. P137 uses R11/R12. At the required 09:25 control with unset reseedBar require KILL, exempt=0, and no promotion. Any exempt=1 paired with same-bar S2PROMOTE_M15 is NEGATIVE_CONTROL_BREACH / M FAIL and T FAIL regardless of stamp attribution; attribution only explains the breach. Assert exempt=1 iff same-bar promotion on each run row; parity mismatch is M FAIL. A set stamp alone without a promotion does not prove stale-stamp causation; unresolved attribution remains UNRESOLVED/HOLD absent legitimate matching admission. Missing evidence is UNRESOLVED/HOLD. Late Weekly-VWAP bars are regression diagnostics, not same-chain identity. No unrelated 6/8 SHORT ban.'
